# Frontend Guide

The frontend is built with Next.js and is located in the [goweb/](mdc:goweb) directory.

## Key Pages

- [app/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/page.tsx) - Homepage
- [app/game/[gameId]/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/game/[gameId]/page.tsx) - Game page with dynamic route
- [app/play/online/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/play/online/page.tsx) - Online play page
- [app/settings/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/page.tsx) - User settings page

## Important Components

- [components/GoBoard/Board.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/components/GoBoard/Board.tsx) - The Go/Weiqi game board component
- [components/layout/root-layout.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/components/layout/root-layout.tsx) - Main layout component
- [components/play/board/GameControls.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/components/play/board/GameControls.tsx) - Game control UI

## Data Flow

- [hooks/use-game-websocket.ts](mdc:goweb/src/hooks/use-game-websocket.ts) - WebSocket connection for real-time game data
- [contexts/WebSocketContext.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/contexts/WebSocketContext.tsx) - WebSocket context provider
- [store/store.ts](mdc:goweb/src/store/store.ts) - Redux store for state management
